    <string name="webshield_onboarding_title">Why a VPN?</string>
    <string name="webshield_onboarding_body">Android lets an app see site lookups only through a VPN. Web Shield uses it for one thing: checking each site against a list of dangerous ones, on your phone.

• Only lookups (DNS) pass through. Your browsing goes straight to the internet.
• Nothing is sent to a VPN server.
• No browsing history is kept, only how many sites were blocked.

A key icon shows while Web Shield is on.</string>
